    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight Taco</strong> is a short psychological horror experience that will immerse you in a chilling atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480930/extras/c81c160aa8db8b4dbd492e90c6ba2e62.poster.avif?t=1742575893\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480930/extras/c81c160aa8db8b4dbd492e90c6ba2e62.webm?t=1742575893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3480930/extras/c81c160aa8db8b4dbd492e90c6ba2e62.mp4?t=1742575893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a young girl who must face solitude and mystery while waiting for her mother at the taco stand where she works. It\u2019s a rainy night, but that won\u2019t stop some unwelcome visitors from showing up...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Do you dare to spend a night at the stand?</i></p>",
